                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2131/40: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-08-14T17:00:00-05:00">August 14, 1933—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>73. Legation’s 72, August 14, 11 a.m.<anchor n="6" xml:id="d185-f1"/> Lozano
                    authorized today to enter into exploratory conversations pending arrival
                    advisers.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
